flowchart TD
  Start([Bắt đầu]) --> Init[Init sensors + RX]
  Init --> Calib[Calibrate gyro]
  Calib --> Motors[Init ESC & PWM]
  Motors --> Loop[Main loop]
  Loop --> Read[Read IMU + Receiver]
  Read --> Compute[Compute attitude]
  Compute --> PIDNode[PID]
  PIDNode --> Mix[Mix to 4 ESC and clamp]
  Mix --> Output[Write ESC signals]
  Output --> Log[Log/telemetry]
  Log --> Loop
  Read --> Failsafe{"RC/sensor fault?"}
  Failsafe -->|yes| Safe[Set ESC=1000 / safe-mode]
